  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cygnus Affordable Hospitals Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up to INR1,500 million ($ 18.4 million) from ADB&amp;apos;s Ordinary Capital Resources for a 7-year senior, secured, non-convertible debentures (NCD) to support CMPL to expand its network by adding up to 6 new hospitals in tier-2 and tier-3 cities in north India; to refurbish and add specialty departments and additional beds in existing hospitals; installation of rooftop solar systems in its existing/new hospitals; and for working capital support.</narrative>
  </description>
